{"vid":"6zClkN8TbTQ","source":"6zClkN8TbTQ.en.json3","lang":"en","cues":[{"t":3.3,"txt":"You're learning with Nine to Five English - business english for the"},{"t":8.4,"txt":"workplace."},{"t":15.3,"txt":"Hi Tim here with another nine to five english lesson. Today we're going to"},{"t":22.8,"txt":"learn some expressions for answering the phone in english."},{"t":28.4,"txt":"using the telephone is an important part of business"},{"t":33.3,"txt":"but the way we communicate is a little different from"},{"t":36.8,"txt":"in-person conversations. We have some special expressions"},{"t":42.2,"txt":"we use to answer the phone ask for clarification"},{"t":47.1,"txt":"and get a call back. At the start of a phone call"},{"t":51.7,"txt":"it's a good idea to make sure the other person knows"},{"t":55.8,"txt":"who you are. You can identify yourself in a few different ways. Besides saying"},{"t":63.4,"txt":"my name is, we often use the expression this is before our name."},{"t":71,"txt":"But don't try to use this expression in person."},{"t":74.6,"txt":"i only say this is Tim when i'm talking on the phone. Let's practice"},{"t":81.2,"txt":"identifying ourselves at the start of a phone call."},{"t":85.3,"txt":"Listen to each example then repeat it for yourself. Ready? Let's get started!"},{"t":89.6,"txt":"Hi there this is jason locke calling"},{"t":96.1,"txt":"from Milton Enterprises."},{"t":104.1,"txt":"Oh hello my name's Wendy chambers with BMA Bank."},{"t":114.3,"txt":"Good morning Dirk here. How can i help?"},{"t":123.5,"txt":"Hello Francine speaking."},{"t":131.4,"txt":"As you can hear we identify ourselves not only when we call someone else"},{"t":137.8,"txt":"but also when we answer the phone to do that we just say something simple"},{"t":145.5,"txt":"like Tim here or tim speaking now because we only have a person's"},{"t":153.8,"txt":"voice on the phone there's a higher chance we don't"},{"t":157.5,"txt":"understand something it might be a single word or a whole"},{"t":162.9,"txt":"sentence that isn't clear in this situation you need to ask"},{"t":169,"txt":"for clarification you might ask could you repeat that or what was that"},{"t":177.4,"txt":"or you might simply say that you didn't catch something which means you didn't"},{"t":184.8,"txt":"hear correctly let's try some examples of"},{"t":189,"txt":"asking for clarification remember to repeat the examples after you hear"},{"t":195.2,"txt":"them sorry what was that"},{"t":203.8,"txt":"could you repeat that last part again sorry did you say 14 or 40."},{"t":221.5,"txt":"i'm sorry i didn't catch that"},{"t":230.2,"txt":"one very important word you heard several times in those examples is"},{"t":236.9,"txt":"sorry that word helps make our requests more polite"},{"t":242.6,"txt":"you also heard an example of asking for clarification"},{"t":247,"txt":"between two similar words in this case you just ask"},{"t":253.1,"txt":"did you say x or y another common situation is when you"},{"t":260.2,"txt":"need to talk about calling someone back maybe you called a"},{"t":264.9,"txt":"business to talk to someone who's not there or"},{"t":268.9,"txt":"maybe someone called your business to talk to someone who's not in"},{"t":274.3,"txt":"in any case we need to arrange a callback polite ways to arrange a"},{"t":281.5,"txt":"callback often use the expressions could you"},{"t":286.3,"txt":"or would you for example you might say could you ask john to call"},{"t":293.2,"txt":"me back or would you like tom to call you back"},{"t":297.7,"txt":"later and sometimes it's you who has to call someone back"},{"t":304.2,"txt":"because you're busy or have a poor signal in that case you might"},{"t":310.7,"txt":"ask would you mind if i called you back let's try some practice with asking for"},{"t":319,"txt":"a callback using these expressions once again repeat the examples after you"},{"t":325.9,"txt":"hear them could you have dave call me back at this"},{"t":330.3,"txt":"number"},{"t":337.1,"txt":"would you like me to ask mary to return your call"},{"t":346.4,"txt":"please have charlie call me when he's"},{"t":350.8,"txt":"available"},{"t":355.2,"txt":"would you mind if i called you back in 15 minutes"},{"t":365.4,"txt":"one useful expression that we just heard is to have someone do something"},{"t":372.1,"txt":"that is you can say i will have greg call you back tomorrow that just means"},{"t":379.4,"txt":"you are asking greg to call the person back"},{"t":383.8,"txt":"okay so we've practiced some useful expressions"},{"t":388.1,"txt":"but how do these sound in a conversation let's listen to a short dialogue between"},{"t":395.4,"txt":"carly and bob bob is calling carly's office"},{"t":400.2,"txt":"to talk with ginny schwartz but jenny isn't there let's listen"},{"t":407.5,"txt":"hello ace business machines hi this is bob turner may i speak with"},{"t":413.8,"txt":"jenny schwartz sorry but jenny's not in the office"},{"t":418.3,"txt":"right now okay could you have her call me back"},{"t":422.2,"txt":"please"},{"t":425.4,"txt":"does that make sense bob identifies himself"},{"t":429.6,"txt":"and asks to speak with ginny schwartz when carly tells him ginny's out of the"},{"t":435.6,"txt":"office bob asks her to have jenny call him back"},{"t":441.1,"txt":"now it's your turn to practice we'll repeat the dialogue"},{"t":445.6,"txt":"but this time we're going to beep out the second speaker's words"},{"t":450.6,"txt":"you will have to say those parts yourself"},{"t":454.7,"txt":"remember to identify yourself as bob turner and ask to speak with ginny"},{"t":460.7,"txt":"schwartz then you'll politely ask carly to have"},{"t":465,"txt":"ginny call you back ready here we go"},{"t":470.4,"txt":"hello ace business machines sorry but jenny's not in the office"},{"t":481.9,"txt":"right now"},{"t":491.3,"txt":"all right that's all for this lesson we've learned some great ways to"},{"t":496.8,"txt":"identify yourself on the phone ask for clarification"},{"t":501.4,"txt":"and talk about calling someone back we'll be back soon with some more useful"},{"t":508.1,"txt":"english expressions until then so long and happy learning"}],"words":[{"t":3.28,"w":"You're"},{"t":3.28,"w":"learning"},{"t":3.28,"w":"with"},{"t":3.28,"w":"Nine"},{"t":3.28,"w":"to"},{"t":3.28,"w":"Five"},{"t":3.28,"w":"English"},{"t":3.28,"w":"-"},{"t":3.28,"w":"business"},{"t":3.28,"w":"english"},{"t":3.28,"w":"for"},{"t":3.28,"w":"the"},{"t":8.4,"w":"workplace."},{"t":15.28,"w":"Hi"},{"t":15.28,"w":"Tim"},{"t":15.28,"w":"here"},{"t":15.28,"w":"with"},{"t":15.28,"w":"another"},{"t":15.28,"w":"nine"},{"t":15.28,"w":"to"},{"t":15.28,"w":"five"},{"t":15.28,"w":"english"},{"t":15.28,"w":"lesson."},{"t":15.28,"w":"Today"},{"t":15.28,"w":"we're"},{"t":15.28,"w":"going"},{"t":15.28,"w":"to"},{"t":22.8,"w":"learn"},{"t":22.8,"w":"some"},{"t":22.8,"w":"expressions"},{"t":22.8,"w":"for"},{"t":22.8,"w":"answering"},{"t":22.8,"w":"the"},{"t":22.8,"w":"phone"},{"t":22.8,"w":"in"},{"t":22.8,"w":"english."},{"t":28.4,"w":"using"},{"t":28.4,"w":"the"},{"t":28.4,"w":"telephone"},{"t":28.4,"w":"is"},{"t":28.4,"w":"an"},{"t":28.4,"w":"important"},{"t":28.4,"w":"part"},{"t":28.4,"w":"of"},{"t":28.4,"w":"business"},{"t":33.28,"w":"but"},{"t":33.28,"w":"the"},{"t":33.28,"w":"way"},{"t":33.28,"w":"we"},{"t":33.28,"w":"communicate"},{"t":33.28,"w":"is"},{"t":33.28,"w":"a"},{"t":33.28,"w":"little"},{"t":33.28,"w":"different"},{"t":33.28,"w":"from"},{"t":36.8,"w":"in-person"},{"t":36.8,"w":"conversations."},{"t":36.8,"w":"We"},{"t":36.8,"w":"have"},{"t":36.8,"w":"some"},{"t":36.8,"w":"special"},{"t":36.8,"w":"expressions"},{"t":42.239,"w":"we"},{"t":42.239,"w":"use"},{"t":42.239,"w":"to"},{"t":42.239,"w":"answer"},{"t":42.239,"w":"the"},{"t":42.239,"w":"phone"},{"t":42.239,"w":"ask"},{"t":42.239,"w":"for"},{"t":42.239,"w":"clarification"},{"t":47.12,"w":"and"},{"t":47.12,"w":"get"},{"t":47.12,"w":"a"},{"t":47.12,"w":"call"},{"t":47.12,"w":"back."},{"t":47.12,"w":"At"},{"t":47.12,"w":"the"},{"t":47.12,"w":"start"